node. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains or NodeRotation smart contract - Schain must exist"},"addSchainType(uint8,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Admin to add schain type"},"changeLifetime(bytes32,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schains contract to change the Schain lifetime through an additional SKL token deposit. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains smart contract - Schain must exist"},"checkException(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Returns whether any exceptions exist for node in a schain group. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"checkHoleForSchain(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Checks if the node is in holes for the schain Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"checkSchainOnNode(uint256,bytes32)":{"details":"Checks if the node is assigned for the schain Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"createGroupForSchain(bytes32,uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Allows Schain contract to create a node group for an schain. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains smart contract - Schain must exist"},"deleteGroup(bytes32)":{"details":"Allows Schains contract to delete a group of schains Requirements: - Message sender is Schains smart contract - Schain must exist"},"getActiveSchain(uint256)":{"details":"Returns last active schain of a node."},"getActiveSchains(uint256)":{"details":"Returns active schains of a node."},"getGeneration(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns generation of a particular schain Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getNodeIndexInGroup(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Returns node index in schain group. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getNodesInGroup(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns nodes in an schain group. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getNumberOfNodesInGroup(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns number of nodes in an schain group. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getRoleAdmin(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns the admin role that controls `role`. See {grantRole} and {revokeRole}. To change a role's admin, use {_setRoleAdmin}."},"getRoleMember(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Returns one of the accounts that have `role`. `index` must be a value between 0 and {getRoleMemberCount}, non-inclusive. Role bearers are not sorted in any particular way, and their ordering may change at any point. WARNING: When using {getRoleMember} and {getRoleMemberCount}, make sure you perform all queries on the same block. See the following https://forum.openzeppelin.com/t/iterating-over-elements-on-enumerableset-in-openzeppelin-contracts/2296[forum post] for more information."},"getRoleMemberCount(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns the number of accounts that have `role`. Can be used together with {getRoleMember} to enumerate all bearers of a role."},"getSchainHashesByAddress(address)":{"details":"Returns hashes of schain names by schain owner."},"getSchainHashesForNode(uint256)":{"details":"Returns hashes of schain names running on a node."},"getSchainListSize(address)":{"details":"Returns number of schains by schain owner."},"getSchainName(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns schain name. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getSchainOriginator(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns an originator of the schain. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getSchainOwner(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns the owner of an schain. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"getSchains()":{"details":"Returns all Schains in the network."},"getSchainsPartOfNode(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns all occupied resources on one node for an Schain. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"grantRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Grants `role` to `account`. If `account` had not been already granted `role`, emits a {RoleGranted} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role."},"hasRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Returns `true` if `account` has been granted `role`."},"initializeSchain(string,address,address,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schain contract to initialize an schain."},"isAnyFreeNode(bytes32)":{"details":"Checks whether there are any nodes with free resources for given schain. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"isNodeAddressesInGroup(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Checks whether sender is a node address from a given schain group. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"isOwnerAddress(address,bytes32)":{"details":"Checks whether address is owner of schain. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"isSchainExist(bytes32)":{"details":"Checks whether schain exists."},"isSchainNameAvailable(string)":{"details":"Checks whether schain name is available. TODO Need to delete - copy of web3.utils.soliditySha3"},"isTimeExpired(bytes32)":{"details":"Checks whether schain lifetime has expired. Requirements: - Schain must exist"},"makeSchainNodesInvisible(bytes32)":{"details":"Mark all nodes in the schain as invisible Requirements: - Message sender is NodeRotation or SkaleDKG smart contract - Schain must exist"},"makeSchainNodesVisible(bytes32)":{"details":"Mark all nodes in the schain as visible Requirements: - Message sender is NodeRotation or SkaleDKG smart contract - Schain must exist"},"newGeneration()":{"details":"Increments generation for all new schains Requirements: - Sender must be granted with GENERATION_MANAGER_ROLE"},"pruneNode(uint256)":{"details":"Removes references to deleted schains Remove after upgrade from version 1.9.2"},"removeAllNodesFromSchainExceptions(bytes32)":{"details":"Clear list of nodes that can't be chosen to schain with id {schainHash}"},"removeHolesForSchain(bytes32)":{"details":"Allows Schains contract to remove holes for schains Requirements: - Message sender is Schains smart contract - Schain must exist"},"removeNodeFromExceptions(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schains contract to remove node from exceptions Requirements: - Message sender is Schains, NodeRotation or SkaleManager smart contract - Schain must exist"},"removeNodeFromSchain(uint256,bytes32)":{"details":"Allows Schains and SkaleDKG contracts to remove a node from an schain for node rotation or DKG failure. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains, SkaleDKG or NodeRotation smart contract - Schain must exist"},"removeSchain(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Allows Schains contract to remove an schain from the network. Generally schains are not removed from the system; instead they are simply allowed to expire. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains smart contract - Schain must exist"},"removeSchainForNode(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schains, NodeRotation, and SkaleDKG contracts to remove an schain from a node."},"removeSchainType(uint256)":{"details":"Allows Admin to remove schain type"},"renounceRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Revokes `role` from the calling account. Roles are often managed via {grantRole} and {revokeRole}: this function's purpose is to provide a mechanism for accounts to lose their privileges if they are compromised (such as when a trusted device is misplaced). If the calling account had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must be `account`."},"revokeRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Revokes `role` from `account`. If `account` had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role."},"setException(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schain and NodeRotation contracts to set a Node like exception for a given schain and nodeIndex. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains or NodeRotation smart contract - Schain must exist"},"setNodeInGroup(bytes32,uint256)":{"details":"Allows Schains and NodeRotation contracts to add node to an schain group. Requirements: - Message sender is Schains or NodeRotation smart contract - Schain must exist"},"setNumberOfSchainTypes(uint256)":{"details":"Allows Admin to set number of schain types"}},"title":"SchainsInternal","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"contracts/SchainsInternal.sol":"SchainsInternal"},"evmVersion":"london","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimiz